<title>USA: Wallace Computer gets contract with Maytag.</title>
<headline>Wallace Computer gets contract with Maytag.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wallace Computer Services Inc said Monday that Maytag Corp chose Wallace as its main supplier of information management products including custom forms, labels, computer supplies and other printed support materials.</p>
<p>The contract, estimated to be worth about $15 million annually, is in place for a five-year term.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
